<h2 class="doc-h2">Drawer</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Structurally a Sheet. What vaul adds — and the only reason it exists — is that you can drag it
    shut, which on a phone is the gesture people try before they look for a close button. Past a
    third of the panel it closes; short of that it springs back.
</p>
